    "Html": "<p>October is Breast Cancer Awareness month. Breast cancer is the most common internal cancer among women worldwide. Like many other diseases, the risk of breast cancer may be reduced through diet and lifestyle habits, such as exercising regularly and eating a plant-centered diet. For more information and all of the videos I have on this subject, visit the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/breast-cancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">topic page</a>. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Recipe: Szechuan Tempeh and Broccoli</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-69052 size-large alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Szechuan Tempeh and Broccoli phto\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Szechuan-Tempeh-and-Broccoli-phto-e1634656075334.jpg 1997w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>In the United States, Chinese takeout is often loaded with oil and sodium, but this version (from </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet-cookbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The How Not to Diet Cookbook</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">) lets you enjoy the classic Szechuan stir-fry at home without all of that grease and salt. Customize this recipe with a variety of your favorite veggies to suit your taste and to take advantage of what you already have on hand. Get the free recipe </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/szechuan-tempeh-and-broccoli/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and watch how it’s made on our </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CPTilx0JxDh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instagram</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>Get Your Holiday Recipe Guide</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-69044 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-1024x1018.jpg\" alt=\"food images on brown background\" width=\"201\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-1024x1018.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-960x955.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-768x764.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-720x716.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe-540x537.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Recipe.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a>Check out our green-light holiday recipe guide! <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\">Subscribe</a> to our free newsletter and receive four recipes for your holiday meals.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>Our New Merch Celebrating Diversity</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-69048 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"143\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-960x640.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-768x512.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-720x480.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/NutritionFacts_27-540x360.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a>There are two months left to get our limited-time </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NF Celebrates Diversity</span></i> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">shirt</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or </span>mug<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">! We have long stressed the importance of dietary diversity. Each plant family has a unique combination of phytonutrients, which is one of the reasons I developed the</span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Dozen</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to encourage eating a variety of the very best foods each day for health and longevity. We also continue to share life-saving, life-changing science-based information to communities around the world, which is why everything on our</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">website</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is free and all of our videos are translated into multiple languages. We’re thankful we get to take part in helping to make the world a more healthful place for everyone. All of the proceeds from the sale of our </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">diversity shirt</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> will support </span><a href=\"https://foodispower.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Food Empowerment Project</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, a nonprofit food justice organization.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Volunteer Spotlight: Robin Everson</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Robin.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-69050 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Robin.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"287\"/></a>I enjoy being a NutritionFacts.org volunteer. I help Dr. Greger with his social media pages so he can focus his time on research and writing. For more than seven years, I have been helping people find the answers they are looking for on the website, as well as inspiring others to fulfill their health desires.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">My favorite recipe is an easy Asian-inspired cruciferous salad of shredded curly kale, Brussels sprouts, red and green cabbage, carrots, broccoli, and edamame. Top it with the juice of a lime, your favorite dressing, or a light peanut sauce, and add a small handful of raw peanuts and sesame seeds for a nutritious, hearty dish.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>Seeking Spanish Translation Volunteers</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-69046 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"illustration of a handshake on blue background\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/Mailchimp-Volunteer.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Our Spanish-language volunteer team is expanding, and we’re looking for a few more professional translators to join us. We have been translating new blogs and videos, as well as developing topic pages and other areas of NutritionFacts.org, to provide even more resources to Spanish speakers. Translation volunteers play an important role in helping us share life-changing and life-saving information in Spanish! For more information and to apply, </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">go here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"460\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-68312 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"3D illustration of cells that contain lipid droplets\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-07-How-Low-Should-You-Go-For-Ideal-LDL-Cholesterol.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-low-should-you-go-for-ideal-cholesterol-levels/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Low Should You Go for Ideal Cholesterol Levels?</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Having a so-called normal cholesterol level in a society where it’s normal to drop dead of a heart attack isn’t necessarily a good thing.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-68322 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Liquid aminos in a bowl\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-09-The-Side-Effects-of-3-MCPD-in-Bragg’s-Liquid-Aminos.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-side-effects-of-3-mcpd-in-braggs-liquid-aminos/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Side Effects of 3-MCPD in Bragg’s Liquid Aminos</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chlorohydrin contaminates hydrolyzed vegetable protein products and refined oils.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-68391 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"hands opening plant based baked dish with brussels sprouts, parsley, corn.\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/55-11-Hospitals-with-100-Plant-Based-Menus.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/hospitals-with-100-percent-plant-based-menus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hospitals with 100 Percent Plant-Based Menus</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The American Medical Association has passed a resolution encouraging hospitals to provide healthy plant-based food options.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>Live Q&amp;A on Thurs, Nov 18 </b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-68737 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"image of dr greger \" width=\"199\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\"/></a>Every other month, I do a live Q&amp;A from my treadmill, and it’s happening on Thursday, November 18!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Join on our </span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facebook</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> page or </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> channel at 3pm ET. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time!</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can find links to past live Q&amp;As </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember, I have an </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">audio podcast</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to keep you company, too. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
